      "description": "Scrollable compact table preserving null power and historical source qualifiers.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-table-scroll\"><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th class=\"ds-th\"># / condition</th><th class=\"ds-th\">Voltage</th><th class=\"ds-th\">Circuit / load</th><th class=\"ds-th\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ds-td\"><strong class=\"ds-condition\">A dry yeast green bag · control</strong><small class=\"ds-table-note\">Source-reported · N01</small></td><td class=\"ds-td\">75 mV</td><td class=\"ds-td\">Unknown</td><td class=\"ds-td\">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
